#20300
The Immortal Map Room of Spiritwood~
   The "map" command is useful for the forest given it's size. The area has
been redesigned to get rid of a lot of the confusion and it is now rather
logically set out.
~
203 cdgjm 0
S
#20301
Spiritwood~
   You are standing at what seems to be the edge of the vast forest known as
Spiritwood to the orcs. Mountains rise sharply to the north and west making
travel in those directions impossible. At the horizon, to the east, you see
the huge grey shape of the Kretrun mountain chain but that is some distance
away. You may move along the edge of the forest by continuing to the east or
you may enter these vast, dark woods to the south.
~
203 0 3
D1
~
~
0 0 20302
D2
~
~
0 0 20312
S
#20302
Spiritwood~
   Cold, mountain air rushes past you from the high peaks above. The trees
of Spiritwood to the south almost act as an impenetrable wall, hence the
air circulates solely in this area creating quite a breeze. The sounds of
life abound from the depths of the forest but light does not penetrate the
canopy and you cannot see any deeper beyond the first few trees.
~
