#20303
Spiritwood~
   There is a soft orange glow far to the south and you think you can just
make out smoke rising lazily from the tree tops. Specks in the sky, most
likely birds, circle the smoke looking for an easy insect meal - from here,
it looks like it could take days to even reach but your perception from
the edge of the woods is very distorted.
~
