#20304
Spiritwood~
   Several pair of red eyes stare at you intently from the safety of the
darkness to the south, either inquisitive looks or perhaps sizing up their
next meal. High mountain peaks prevent passage to the north and stretch as
far as the eye can see to the west and east.
~
