#20305
Spiritwood~
   The orcs call these woods Spiritwood and you think you know why - all
manner of sounds come from its depths although you can see nothing. You
think you can see creatures dash by but perhaps it's only your imagination.
Away to the southeast, you see the dominant peaks of the Kretrun mountain
chain, stretching far to the south. You can continue along the forest edge
by travelling east or west.
~
