Spiritwood~
   The seemingly boundless, gloomy forest in which you stand is known as
Spiritwood. The strong trees rise far overhead and fill the air with a foul-
smelling mist. Noises can be heard from the surrounding darkness but given 
the immenseness of this place, you are unable to determine from where.
