#20316
Spiritwood~
   The dark trees here tower overhead, blocking any traces of light or fresh
air. Strange echoes from the trees play tricks on your imagination, making you
feel that someone or something must be watching you from within the branches.
At least, you hope it's only your imagination. The dark woods continue in all
directions.
~
