#20317
Spiritwood~
   You stand deep within the forest, listening intently for any sound of
danger. Occasionally, you spot the tracks of some large animal which must have
passed this way recently. The trees rise high above, their branches reaching
downward toward you as if to ensnare you in their embrace, and hold you here
forever in darkness. The forest seems to continue endlessly in all directions.
~
