#20318
Spiritwood~
   Dense trees close in around you, causing you to lose all sense of direction.
The thick undergrowth in the forest appears to be interlaced with the trails
of small game. Occasionally, you hear something scamper through the bracken
nearby, although you see no movement in the foliage. The dark forest continues
in all directions.
