Spiritwood~
   This huge, mystical woodland is known simply as Spiritwood; the origin
of such a name unknown to you. The evil, lofty trees in this part of the
forest emit a strange, yellowish pollen. Every once in a while, you note a
small forest animal crouching in the darkness but before you can approach,
it is gone.
