#20354
Spiritwood~
   The air here is hot, foul-smelling and incredibly stale. It's as if there
is no air flow within these woods which is not so hard to believe. The lofty
trees tower high above your head and block out almost all sources of natural
light. Sounds echo around in the darkness and you quickly lose any sense of
bearing. This vast forest seems to continue forever in every direction.
~
