Spiritwood~
   The air in this part of the forest is positively stifling - the sky
blanketed with dark, leafy branches holding in the oppressive, stagnant air.
The silent trees grow thick here, making sounds echo strangely in the darkness.
The air hangs heavy with mist and pollen, making breathing difficult. The dense
forest continues in all directions.
~
