The Edge of the Forest~
   The treeline begins here, separating the dense woods to the south from the
dry, rocky slope to the north. A winding trail leads northward along the base
of a tall mountain, and into a deep valley.
   The cold breeze, carried down from the mountains, smells strongly of
sulfur. It is becoming quite cold.
~
