Spiritwood~
   The air is thick and rank, even though you find yourself on the edge of
this huge forest. The strong trees in this area completely block out any
source of light and a heavy, silvery fog swirls around your ankles. You can
journey to the south along the edge of the forest or venture into its depths
to the west.
