#20453
Spiritwood~
   You cast your gaze to the north and south and from this position, you
estimate you have reached approximately the middle of the woods. The strong
trees to the east reach up towards the heavens and fill the air with a
fine, powder-like pollen making it difficult to breathe. You can skirt the
edge of the trees by journeying to the north or you may enter the woods to
the south and east.
~
