Spiritwood~
  You stand amidst the tall, dark trees in the dark forest the orcs call
Spiritwood. You notice that the tall, mystical trees in this area appear to
be quite old and fill the thick air with a rotten-grey pollen. The intense
heat is starting to affect you and you swear you can hear whispering in the
trees. For as far as the eye can see, these gloomy woods continue in any
direction.
