blanketed with dark, leafy branches holding in the oppressive, stagnant air.
The silent trees grow thick here, making sounds echo strangely in the darkness.
The air hangs heavy with mist and pollen, making breathing difficult. An
enormous mountain peak stretches far above your head to the north, preventing
travel in that direction.
