Spiritwood~
   Cold, mountain air rushes past you from the high peaks above. The trees
of Spiritwood to the north almost act as an impenetrable wall, hence the
air circulates solely in this area creating quite a breeze. The sounds of
life abound from the depths of the forest but light does not penetrate the
canopy and you cannot see any deeper beyond the first few trees.
